          "Build renter-community engagement: at 24.5%, renters represent approximately one in four households with direct stakes in housing affordability, rental protections, and service-dependent community investment — constituencies whose interests diverge from homeowner-majority policy and who have no existing partisan loyalty anchoring them to the incumbent.",
          "Govern as though competition exists: unopposed victory in 2024 provides no signal of latent opposition strength or the viability of a challenger-driven narrative; active constituent service, visible delivery on material concerns, and preventive relationship-building across all demographic segments are the actual safeguards against a future competitive challenge."
