          "Avoid the unopposed incumbent trap: use this cycle to demonstrate legislative output, constituent responsiveness, and problem-solving on the material concerns of working-age renters and economically constrained households; if the next cycle produces a challenger and the incumbent has been silent, the 100% will evaporate quickly."
