          "Engage young professionals on student debt, education ROI, and healthcare access: college-educated renters at this income level carry student loan burdens and face healthcare costs that consume meaningful portions of income. Policy specificity on loan forgiveness, public service programs, healthcare affordability, and the connection between education and actual economic opportunity is essential to hold this coalition.",
