          "Do not assume that college-educated or young adults are a safe Democratic base: in a district at 57%, where education and youth are the dominant demographic story, complacency about generational or educational voting patterns will invite a challenger who speaks more credibly to the material concerns these constituencies face in a high-cost-of-living urban market."
