          "Address homeowner economic security directly: at 73% non-renter rate with $73,532 income and 45.2 median age, the district is dominated by mortgage-holders and property owners exposed to property tax policy, insurance costs, and inflation — incumbent messaging focused on inflation control, tax fairness, and housing affordability is essential to maintaining the homeowner supermajority's Democratic lean.",
