          "Maintain active communication with the property-owning and small business base that constitutes the 75% Republican core; the margin is stable but not unconditional, and any legislative action perceived as threatening property values, increasing regulatory burden, or diverting resources away from rural Montana will erode trust faster than partisan loyalty can sustain it.",
