          "Do not treat the 75% margin as permission to govern without constituent engagement; older, property-owning, higher-income constituencies are sophisticated evaluators of whether state government is protecting their interests, and perceived neglect or prioritization of other regions will translate into reduced turnout or split-ticket voting in the next cycle."
