          "Deliver tangible rural infrastructure outcomes: broadband expansion, healthcare access, road maintenance, and water system reliability are not abstract policy areas but the daily-life issues that determine whether older property owners believe government is serving them — and whether the margin holds in a future competitive cycle.",
