          "Mobilize the 13% demographic gap population through authentic community outreach: American Indian communities, mixed-race residents, and immigrant families in the unaccounted 13.23% are a swing constituency whose turnout and candidate preference are not yet locked into partisan patterns. Early engagement on community-specific economic and healthcare concerns builds the constituent relationships that determine close outcomes.",
