          "Treat the unopposed 2022 victory as a strategic liability, not an asset: 100% in the absence of opposition is not a mandate—it is vulnerability if economic conditions remain stagnant and a challenger articulates an alternative vision; active constituent engagement and measurable legislative responsiveness are required to hold this seat if opposition emerges."
